sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (client)
    participant L as Local store (CRDT)
    participant S as Sync engine
    participant G as Gateway (PQ-mTLS)
    participant F as Object Fabric
    U->>L: edit object (offline OK)
    L->>L: append CRDT op, encrypt at rest
    Note over L,S: connectivity returns
    S->>G: PQ-mTLS handshake (X25519+ML-KEM-768)
    G-->>S: session established
    S->>F: push sealed CRDT ops
    F-->>S: merged state + remote ops
    S->>L: merge remote ops (conflict-free)
    L-->>U: updated view
    Note over F: policy + markings enforced server-side
